.TH ATLIFM 1 "October 2026" "atlifm 1.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
atlifm \- terminal-style file manager with GUI features
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B atlifm
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ directory ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B atlifm
is a mouse-first file manager with a terminal-like multi-pane layout.
It provides Miller columns (parent, current directory and preview pane),
tabs, drag and drop, archive browsing and extraction, previews for images,
SVG, source code and binaries, full undo/redo for file operations, and an
XDG desktop portal FileChooser backend.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-portal
Run as the XDG desktop portal FileChooser backend (D-Bus activatable).
.TP
.B \-\-setdefault
Install and configure atlifm as both the default file manager and the XDG
FileChooser portal backend for the current user.
.TP
.B \-\-setup\-portal
Install and configure atlifm as the default XDG FileChooser portal backend
for the current user.
.TP
.B \-\-setup\-file\-manager
Install and configure atlifm as the default file manager for the current user,
including the
.B org.freedesktop.FileManager1
D-Bus service used by Telegram, browsers and other applications.
.TP
.BI \-\-properties " path"
Open atlifm with the properties panel shown for
.IR path .
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I directory
Initial directory to open.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/atlifm/keybinds.conf
Key bindings. Created automatically on first launch.
.TP
.I ~/.config/atlifm/theme.conf
Window, font and color settings. Created automatically on first launch.
.TP
.I ~/.config/atlifm/plugins/
Plugin directory. One
.I .conf
file per external command plugin; executable
.IR .sh ", " .py " or " .bash
files are picked up automatically; native plugins are
.I .so
files exporting
.BR atlifm_plugin_init .
.SH SEE ALSO
Documentation: https://1nfys.github.io/atlifml/docs/welcome
.br
Project: https://github.com/1nfys/atlifm
